# 统一行尾，避免 Windows/Linux 协作时整文件 diff
* text=auto eol=lf

# 二进制资源不做行尾转换
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.dll binary
*.pyd binary
*.exe binary
*.ico binary
*.onnx binary
*.mp3 binary
*.zip binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary

